 tools, books, coins, gear, work parts, 3D printed parts, and more.\nCreate custom collections, add detailed item records, attach photos, scan barcodes, generate QR labels, track values, and export your collection data when you need it. Whether you are cataloging a hobby, keeping records for insurance, organizing work inventory, or identifying 3D printed parts, Collect This! keeps everything organized in one simple place.\nFeatures include:\nCreate multiple collections\nAdd item photos from your camera or photo library\nTrack item details, notes, values, serial numbers, and custom fields\nAutomatically assign unique Item IDs\nGenerate printable QR code labels for inventory items\nScan QR codes to quickly open matching item records\nCreate 3D printed part records with part numbers, revisions, material, print file locations, and install notes\nDesign labels with QR codes, item names, company logos, revision numbers, and category color bands\nScan barcodes for faster entry\nSearch across collections and items\nView collection statistics\nExport or print PDF reports\nExport CSV files for spreadsheets\nStore your data locally on your device  \nCollect This Inventory is built for collectors, makers, and small teams who want a practical, private, and easy way to keep track of their stuff.", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "minimumOsVersion": "17.6", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "13319168", "formattedPrice": "무료", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackContentRating": "4+", "userRatingCount": 0}]}